{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"agent_message","text":"Implemented Turn 1. Holds block overlapping bookings in the same room until their expiration minute. `confirmHold` confirms an active hold and clears its expiry. Back-to-back bookings remain valid.\n\nPricing now accepts any positive integer duration and rounds the subtotal to cents before calculating tax. The public rounding helper uses `BigInt` internally to keep the half-up calculation exact. All three new helpers are re-exported from `src/index.ts`.\n\nAdded six `node:test` tests. `node benchmarks/sources/ev2_ts_bookings/run_checks.mjs` exited 0 with all 9 tests passing. Node ran the `.ts` files directly with zero npm dependencies."}}
